t a trap. Here they call it a launch. Now, the question you care about, can they reach us? They plan to return to their own moon in 2028. Their own moon, the one directly above them. They have been there before. And then, as far as I can tell, they forgot how. Neither of the two landers is finished. My assessment, the humans are not a threat to us. The humans are a threat to the humans. Recommendation, cancel the invasion. It would be rude to interrupt. They are doing an excellent job without us. One, more budget for hats. Two, please stop calling my communicator. It rings in the middle of the news appeal. This has been tech for bad guys. The bad guys being you, sirs. Agent Peek, end of transmission.",
